{"height": 13, "weight": 444, "base_experience": 172, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "attack", "value": 2}], "genus": "Toxic Mouth Pokémon", "capture_rate": 75, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 20, "growth_rate": "medium", "egg_groups": ["humanshape"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ドクロッグ"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Dokurog"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "독개굴"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "毒骷蛙"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Coatox"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Toxiquak"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Toxicroak"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Toxicroak"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ドクロッグ"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "毒骷蛙"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Toxicroak"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["diamond", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal."}, {"versions": ["pearl"], "text": "The toxin made in its poison sacs is pumped to the knuckle claws through tubes down its arms."}, {"versions": ["platinum", "black", "white", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency."}, {"versions": ["heartgold", "soulsilver"], "text": "Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2"], "text": "The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "It bounces toward opponents and gouges them with poisonous claws. No more than a scratch is needed to knock out its adversaries."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "It booms out a victory croak when its prey goes down in defeat. This Pokémon and Seismitoad are related species."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "Its crimson claws contain a virulent toxin. This toxin can be made into a tonic by diluting it, mixing it with 